  "body": "## kew 4.4.3\r\n\r\nThis release fixes kew sometimes hanging at the end of a song, the scrollbar not scrolling all the way to the top and a few other things.\r\n\r\nSpecial thanks to @Erwin-Iosef for making many PRs!\r\n\r\n/Ravachol\r\n\r\n#### Enhancements\r\n\r\n- Added error message if kew fails to play song because it's missing or corrupt. By @Erwin-Iosef.\r\n\r\n- Erase whole words from search query with Ctrl+Backspace. By @Erwin-Iosef. Suggested by @yeka1063.\r\n\r\n- Add build option DEBUG=3 mode which has fsanitize=thread enabled. By @ravachol.\r\n\r\n#### Bug fixes\r\n\r\n- Fix kew sometimes hanging at the end of a song. By @ravachol.\r\n\r\n- Fix scrollbar not scrolling all the way. By @ravachol.\r\n\r\n- Bumped miniaudio to v0.11.26. By @ravachol.\r\n\r\n- Fix error message in some cases disappearing before the 3 second timeout. By @Erwin-Iosef.\r\n\r\n- Revert change that made some options stop working. By @Erwin-Iosef. Reported by @washingmachine55.\r\n\r\n- Fix use after return in visualization build cmd functions. By @ravachol.\r\n\r\n- Fix data race related to seek_elapsed. By @ravachol.\r\n\r\n- Fix data race related to visualizations running variable. By @ravachol.\r\n\r\n- Fix data race related to visualizations mode variable. By @ravachol.\r\n\r\n- Fix passthrough for forced coverStyle inside tmux. By @rdocksey.",
